, 2 bathrooms and 1 underground parking stall. Through the door there is a nice entry space and front closet. There is also in suite laundry which opens up to gorgeous kitchen, quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances and modern cabinets. The open concept dining and living room make it great for entertaining. Laminate flooring spreads throughout the condo-could use some repair has been priced accordingly. The 2nd bedroom is a great size and could accommodate a queen size bed with a 4 piece bathroom just outside the door. The primary bedroom is huge with a substantial walk-in closet and a full 3 piece ensuite. The patio is fully enclosed great for pets. The unit is completed by an underground parking stall right next to the stairwell. Amazing location with every store, restaurant, public transport right out the door. Come view today! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$179,900"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","895 sq ft"],["Year built","2015"],["Condo fee","$499 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Eaux Claires"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5Z0N1"],["MLS® number","E4514005"],["Listed","October 23, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Garage door opener remote(s), Washer/Dryer Stack-Up"],["Heating","In Floor Heating"],["Parking","Underground, Heated Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.23 m × 4.92 m (10'7\" × 16'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.52 m × 1.83 m (14'10\" × 6'0\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.51 m × 2.18 m (14'10\" × 7'2\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.28 m × 4.15 m (10'9\" × 13'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","2.76 m × 3.72 m (9'1\" × 12'2\")"]],"courtesy":"Chrystal Smith, Exp Realty and Matthew Barry, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"eaux-claires","area":"northeast-